       the building helpers (GetBuildingOverview / Bills / Storage /
       Power / BedAssignment / OwnerAssignment / MeditationFocus /
       Temperature). Vanilla nouns reused: Health, Priority, Power,
       Temperature, Suspended, On, Off.
       ================================================================= -->
  <!-- Overview. Health: {0} = percent, {1} = current HP, {2} = max HP.
       The vanilla "Health" noun is used as the leading label; the
       composition lives in C# so the Description: header keeps reusing
       the shared DescriptionHeader key. -->
  <RimWorldAccess.Inspection.Building.Health>Health: {0} ({1} / {2})</RimWorldAccess.Inspection.Building.Health>

  <!-- Bills. BillsHeader: {0} = count. BillEntry: {0} = index, {1} = bill
