  <!-- BuildingOwnerAssignmentState: keyboard-driven assign/unassign menu
       for non-bed CompAssignableToPawn (thrones, graves, meditation
       spots, etc.). MainMenu.* are the three top-level menu options;
       the C# code dispatches on an enum so the labels can vary per
       language. {0} = building label, {1} = comma-joined assigned names,
       {2} = currently-highlighted option label.
       AssignReason.* are short parenthetical hints that describe why a
       candidate cannot be assigned right now. ResultAssigned /
       ResultUnassigned: {0} = pawn short-name, {1} = building label.
       Failure forms cover the cases where TryAssignPawn /
       TryUnassignPawn does not actually move the pawn into / out of the
       owner list. -->
